# edit: Claude (Sonnet 5, G4 builder B), 2026-09-19 21:32 +0400 — B1 (docs/briefs/G4-BUILDER-B-GENES.md).
# Every new gene below is declared but the machinery does not yet WIRE most of them into a life (B2–B7
# land the interpreters one at a time; PARK's toy runs today per B4, FAST per B3, PREDICT/FILE per B6,
# SLEEP/CYCLE per B7). CURIOSITY, INDUCE, DEDUCE, BELIEF, SENTENCE, WORLD, HANDS, TRAITS, SURPRISE are
# Wave 2 (PREREG §3): they parse and REFUSE nothing, but nothing runs them yet.
SEED     20260920
# BODY
BODY     service creature threads eye ear door mind voice
TAPE     run/tape                                  # every sense delivery: instant, sense, sha256; the mind reads only the tape
HEART    every 10 s                                # STATUS counters on every branch; liveness = motion
CRASH    sense restart journal; mind page          # a sense's error never kills the mind; a mind error pages, never loops (#230)
# SENSES
SENSE    eye    32x32 grey                         # the sealed tower's frame (G0b)
RETINA   thresh0.25 centre tower:eye-tower-g2 sqrt unit
GAZE     surprise fixations 4 grid 16 canvas 128 glance 32 ink border   # G1 §6 (the proven value; PREREG §1 correction)
#OFF TRAITS   contrast head 32 lr 0.01 at sleep         # NEW: a small head over the frozen tower, learned by contrast from replayed episodes   # OFF (PREREG §12): InfoNCE over canvas instances learns instance identity after 5 sleeps (margin −0.116 < raw 0.009); wave 3 = same-cell positives
SENSE    ear    letters 8
#OFF SURPRISE floor 0.05                                # a sense publishes when |actual − predicted| > floor (V0.1's rule on every sense)   # OFF (PREREG §12): no sense on the maker/folder streams needs it yet
# AREAS + MEET (G0b)
AREA     sight  from retina
AREA     words  from ear
AREA     episodes from fast
MEET     sight  words
# GROW / WIRE / SHRINK (G0b verbatim)
BIRTH    novelty  cos<0.952
BIRTH    error    misfires 3
BUDGET   400 per arrival
NMAX     2000
KWTA     5
HEBB     window 1
DELTA    lr 0.05
PRUNE    w<0.02 after 3 chances
MERGE    cos>0.9969 same-answer
SCALE    every 1000 moments
CYCLE    grow to 0.9 nmax then consolidate         # NEW: the cap becomes a cycle (D41)
# MEMORY, fast and slow
FAST     episodes 20000 keys sight words surprise  # one-shot rows; nearest-neighbour recall
SLEEP    every 2000 moments replay 200 by surprise # the most surprising episodes replayed into SLOW; TRAITS learns then
# PREDICT — the one modulator
PREDICT  next glance; error scales delta 0.5..2.0; ranks replay; grades act
FILE     claim route decider due                   # the falsifiability law: four fields or refused by name
# ATTENTION / CURIOSITY / METACOGNITION
CURIOSITY interests 50 operators recombine generalize specialize bridge   # chooses what to THINK about and which door to open, never whether to perceive
PARK     after 3 identical dead-ends reopen on new-sense                  # D39
# THINKING
#OFF INDUCE   rule from 5 episodes no counter      # a rule is a prediction   # OFF (PREREG §14): B11's toy PASS, but the mind has no INDUCE interpreter (think_laws.induce is never called) — a declared gene the machinery does not run must refuse
#OFF DEDUCE   one step                             # two beliefs → a prediction   # OFF (PREREG §14): same — think_laws.deduce is never called by the mind; wave 3 wires both
BELIEF   clash opens never overwrites               # Alpha 2's scope law
THINK    every 10 canvases                        # §11.1 step 3: the pool → CURIOSITY chooses → work → PARK/FILE
EXAM     every 2000 canvases                      # §11.4: the self-exam from the voice, the key outside him
FROZEN   after 50 cells                           # twin-only gene (§11.1 step 5): the frozen twin's ceiling
# LANGUAGE
#OFF SENTENCE two-word frames is near under-judge       # speech_v2's road, minimal; never next-token   # OFF (PREREG §12): wave 3 — no interpreter yet; a declared gene the machinery does not run must refuse
# HANDS + WORLD
WORLD    drawn every 5 s arrivals every 6 h; folder world/; web 6 per hour by curiosity
#OFF HANDS    jail alpha3/hands/jail_run                # switched on last   # OFF (PREREG §12): wave 3
# ANSWER
RECALL   k=3
ABSTAIN  second/best > 0.85
ASK      what-is show is which next why
# STAGES
STAGE    1 senses   moments 0..200
STAGE    2 meet     moments 200..
